  "notes": "Refers to marrying again after a divorce or the death of a spouse. Unlike {初婚|しょこん} (first marriage), {再婚|さいこん} implies a previous marriage has ended.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {再婚|さいこん}する: to remarry\n- {再婚|さいこん}{相手|あいて}: a remarriage partner\n- {再婚|さいこん}{禁止|きんし}{期間|きかん}: waiting period before remarriage\n- {再婚|さいこん}{家庭|かてい}: a blended family\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {初婚|しょこん}: first marriage\n- {離婚|りこん}: divorce\n- {結婚|けっこん}: marriage\n- {連|つ}れ{子|こ}: a child from a previous marriage",
